00:06:04.966 --> 00:06:07.066
So let's say they have these
free speech zones, right?

00:06:07.066 --> 00:06:08.700
They say, okay, listen,
it's a public school.

00:06:08.700 --> 00:06:10.166
We're supposed to uphold
the First Amendment,

00:06:10.166 --> 00:06:12.866
